\title{kcloud.r: One API for Local, 'Nextcloud', 'S3' and 'rclone' Data Storages}
\description{
Read and write data files with the same functions wherever they are stored: on a local disk or on 'Nextcloud' (public link or account, through 'WebDAV'), and soon in 'S3' buckets and 'rclone' remotes. Remote files are downloaded into a persistent cache whose freshness is checked with the 'ETag' of the files and whose size is bounded. Storages are described in a 'config.yml' file, with the secrets read from environment variables.
